{"id":2241,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2241"},"modified":"2025-10-02T14:41:44","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T14:41:44","slug":"branded-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/branded-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Branded Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Custom Logo Printing and Full-Color Options Available<\/h2>\n<p>Branded cardboard boxes help your business stand out from the moment your product is seen. Whether you\u2019re shipping, displaying, or stocking products, custom packaging adds identity and value to every shipment. At Shop Cardboard Boxes, we offer <strong>branded cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> in all sizes, styles, and designs to match your brand goals.<\/p>\n<p>Our boxes are made with quality cardboard and printed using advanced methods to deliver clean, professional results. We offer <strong>custom packaging boxes with logo<\/strong>, full-color print, and coating options like Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV \u2014 all available with free design support and fast shipping.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"256\">Stand Out with Custom Branded Packaging<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"478\">Your packaging is often the first physical connection your customer has with your brand. That\u2019s why we offer <strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"401\">custom branded cardboard boxes<\/strong> designed to match your product dimensions, design needs, and brand identity.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"622\">Whether you\u2019re a new business or shipping in high volume, our boxes help you create a consistent look across every order. You can choose from:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"800\">\n<li data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"674\">\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"674\">White SBS cardboard for high-end print clarity<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"715\">\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"715\">Kraft or eco-friendly recycled board<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"756\">\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"756\">Corrugated or rigid cardboard styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"800\">\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"800\">CMYK or PMS spot color printing options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"940\">Every box is made to order with secure fitting dimensions\u2014keeping your product safe during shipping and enhancing your professional image.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\" \/>\n<h3>Printing and Material Options That Support Brand Visibility<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1240\">Your logo, artwork, or marketing message can be printed on any side of the box using high-resolution digital or offset techniques. Add-ons like matte, gloss, or Spot UV coating give your packaging a finished, premium appearance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1449\">Need eco-conscious packaging? We offer biodegradable and recyclable board options without compromising strength or visual appeal. Lamination and finishing styles can be matched to your brand&#8217;s look and feel.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1454\" \/>\n<h3>From Shipping to Display \u2013 One Box, Many Uses<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1570\">These custom branded boxes are used across many industries for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1765\">\n<li data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1613\">\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1613\">E-commerce and subscription shipments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1650\">\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1650\">Promotional kits or sample packs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1691\">\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1691\">Display packaging for retail shelves<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1726\">\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1726\">Giveaway or launch event boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1765\">\n<p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1765\">Relocation and branded moving kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1861\">They are strong enough to ship across long distances yet sleek enough for retail presentation.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2155\">If you&#8217;re looking for clean, minimalist packaging options, you might also be interested in our <strong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2048\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/white-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2046\">White Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>. These are especially popular for brands seeking a blank canvas for creative branding or premium unboxing.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2160\" \/>\n<h3>Order Custom Boxes with Confidence<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2211\">We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2430\">\n<li data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2252\">\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2252\">Custom box sizes and die-cut shapes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2289\">\n<p data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2289\">Short-run and bulk order options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2327\">\n<p data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2327\">Fast turnaround and free shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2374\">\n<p data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2374\">Free design support and print consultation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2430\">\n<p data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2430\">Coating finishes: Matte, Gloss, Soft-Touch, Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2574\">No matter your packaging goal, our custom solutions help your product stand out during delivery, in-store, or at events. Ready to get started?<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Branded Cardboard Boxes Wholesale Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Common Box Styles and Size Variants<\/h3>\n<p>We make boxes in all dimensions \u2014 from small flat mailers to large bulk packaging. Here are some of the most frequently used types:<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage \/ Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Box Style<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Mailer: Easy-to-assemble, self-locking design for lightweight items<br \/>\n&#8211; Straight Tuck: Classic tuck ends, secure closure<br \/>\n&#8211; Shipping: Heavy-duty with reinforced edges for protection<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Kraft Paper: Durable, eco-friendly brown paper<br \/>\n&#8211; White SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate): Smooth, white surface ideal for high-quality printing<br \/>\n&#8211; Corrugated Board: Multi-layered for extra strength and cushioning<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Gloss Lamination: Shiny, vibrant look, protects print<br \/>\n&#8211; Matte Lamination: Non-reflective, elegant finish<br \/>\n&#8211; Spot UV Coating: Selective glossy highlights for branding<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Tear Strips: Easy opening feature<br \/>\n&#8211; Thumb Notches: Convenient access points<br \/>\n&#8211; Reinforced Seams: Extra durability for heavy items<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Ecommerce Packaging: Lightweight, protective for shipping<br \/>\n&#8211; Retail Kits: Attractive presentation for product sets<br \/>\n&#8211; Subscription Boxes: Reusable and branded packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Size Range<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Small: 4&#8243; x 4&#8243; x 2&#8243; (compact items)<br \/>\n&#8211; Medium: 10&#8243; x 8&#8243; x 4&#8243; (standard parcels)<br \/>\n&#8211; Large: Up to 18&#8243; x 12&#8243; x 4&#8243; (bulkier products)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Recycled Board: Environmentally friendly, cost-effective<br \/>\n&#8211; Premium Board: Higher stiffness and print quality<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Embossing: Raised patterns or logos for tactile branding<br \/>\n&#8211; Soft-touch Lamination: Velvet-like feel for luxury packaging<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Logo Windows: Transparent cut-outs showcasing product or branding<br \/>\n&#8211; Custom Flaps: Unique flap designs for enhanced aesthetics<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Branded Cardboard Boxes: Cost-effective marketing through packaging<br \/>\n&#8211; Gift Boxes: Premium look for special occasions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Printing<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; CMYK Full-color: Vibrant, multi-color printing<br \/>\n&#8211; No-Print: Plain boxes for budget or minimalist branding<br \/>\n&#8211; Inside-Outside Print: Branding on all surfaces<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Digital Printing: Quick turnaround, ideal for small runs<br \/>\n&#8211; Offset Printing: High quality, cost-effective for large volumes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Foil Stamping: Metallic accents for luxury effect<br \/>\n&#8211; UV Coating: Glossy, protective layer<br \/>\n&#8211; Anti-scratch Coating: Maintains print integrity during handling<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; QR Codes: Interactive customer engagement<br \/>\n&#8211; Barcodes: Inventory and retail management<br \/>\n&#8211; Custom Artwork: Unique designs tailored to brand identity<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Custom Branded Cardboard Boxes: Enhance brand visibility and customer experience<br \/>\n&#8211; Promotional Packaging: Special edition prints for marketing campaigns<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Best Uses for Branded Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>custom boxes<\/strong> are designed for:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Brand mailers for online stores<\/li>\n<li>Product bundles and PR kits<\/li>\n<li>Branded moving boxes for retail logistics<\/li>\n<li>Corrugated boxes for warehouse use<\/li>\n<li>Luxury boxes for boutique orders<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>All options are available with or without logos depending on your campaign or fulfillment needs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Get Your Logo Seen with Every Delivery<\/h2>\n<h3>Finish Your Packaging with Coatings and Add-ons<\/h3>\n<p>Make your brand memorable with the right coating and finishing touch. Whether you need a clean, matte look or a bold gloss finish \u2014 we\u2019ve got the right options for every purpose.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matte, Gloss, Spot UV, Satin, Soft-touch, Textured<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft, White Board, Recycled Paperboard, Rigid Cardboard, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Soft-touch, Foil stamping, UV coating, Varnish, Laminates<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Deboss, Die-cut logos, Custom textures, Spot gloss<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Best branded cardboard boxes, Luxury packaging, Gift boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Branding<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full bleed or centered print, Custom colors, Pantone matching, Embossing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">White SBS, E-Flute, B-Flute, C-Flute, Double Wall<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Inside\/outside coating, Spot UV, Embossing, Debossing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Folded or flat-pack, Custom shapes, Perforations<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Retail or unboxing campaigns, Promotional packaging, Subscription boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Features<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Inserts, dividers, sleeves, compartments, padding<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated, Rigid, Eco-friendly, Water-resistant, Recyclable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Handle cut-outs, Tabs, Magnetic closures, Velcro, Window patches<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom boxes with logo for shipping, Reinforced corners, Tamper-evident seals<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom shipping boxes, Product protection, E-commerce packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>We also offer embossing, debossing, and cut-out windows for high-end packaging. Ask for samples during your quote process.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Order in Bulk with Free Services and Support<\/h2>\n<h3>Flexible Quantities and Speedy Turnaround<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re scaling up or just starting, our production handles orders from a few hundred to thousands of boxes per week.<\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>100 units<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated cardboard, Kraft paper, White board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss coating, Matte coating, Spot UV coating<\/td>\n<td>Custom logo printing, Branding elements, Variable data printing<\/td>\n<td>Custom packaging boxes with logo for branding and marketing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Delivery Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>7\u201315 business days<\/td>\n<td>Thickness range: 14pt to 28pt board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss finish, Matte finish, Spot UV finish<\/td>\n<td>Pre-glued boxes for easy assembly, Flat shipping to reduce volume<\/td>\n<td>Suitable for bulk orders, retail packaging, e-commerce shipments<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Design &amp; Sampling Support<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Design consultation and sample creation available<\/td>\n<td>All types of boards including recycled and virgin fibers<\/td>\n<td>Multiple laminate options: Glossy, Matte, Soft-touch<\/td>\n<td>Die setup, Plate setup, Sample runs for approval<\/td>\n<td>Wholesale cardboard packaging boxes for businesses and retailers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Customization Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Custom sizes and shapes available<\/td>\n<td>Single-wall and double-wall corrugated options<\/td>\n<td>Embossing, Debossing, Foil stamping<\/td>\n<td>Window patching, Handles, Inserts, QR code printing<\/td>\n<td>Ideal for product packaging, gift boxes, shipping cartons<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sustainability<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Eco-friendly materials and processes<\/td>\n<td>Recyclable and biodegradable materials<\/td>\n<td>Water-based and UV coatings available<\/td>\n<td>Use of soy-based inks, FSC-certified paper<\/td>\n<td>Environmentally responsible packaging solutions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Quality Assurance<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Strict quality control and inspection<\/td>\n<td>Durable and sturdy materials for protection<\/td>\n<td>Scratch-resistant and fade-proof finishes<\/td>\n<td>Reinforced corners and edges for durability<\/td>\n<td>Packaging that ensures product safety during transit<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>You can request blank samples, printed samples, or bulk production directly from our team. Free shipping is included on every wholesale order.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Explore More Through Cardboard Boxes by Functionality<\/h2>\n<h3>Not Just for Branding \u2013 Use by Purpose<\/h3>\n<p>We also offer packaging solutions categorized by use type. Visit our category for <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-functionality\/\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/a><\/strong> to explore packaging for retail, electronics, food, apparel, candles, and more.<\/p>\n<p>All designs can be printed, blank, or pre-scored for fast setup.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Start Your Branded Cardboard Box Project<\/h2>\n<h3>Quick Setup and Fast Support<\/h3>\n<p>Getting your branded boxes is simple:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your size and quantity needs<\/li>\n<li>Upload your artwork or request free design help<\/li>\n<li>Review your 3D digital proof<\/li>\n<li>Approve the sample and start production<\/li>\n<li>Receive your shipment on time<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is a Trusted Supplier<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Low prices on <strong>branded cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Premium-quality material and full-color printing<\/li>\n<li>Free design support and shipping<\/li>\n<li>Multiple finishes including Matte, Gloss, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Options for <strong>custom branded cardboard boxes<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Quick lead times with accurate order handling<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you&#8217;re looking to create the <strong>best branded cardboard boxes<\/strong> for your store or product launch, our team is ready to help.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> for high-quality branded cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. We offer various coating options like gloss, matte, and spot UV. We use high-quality materials and printing options to ensure your brand stands out. Get free design and shipping with your order. Contact us today<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2366,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2241","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Branded Cardboard Packaging Boxes, Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality branded cardboard boxes fo